    {
      "id": "undertow-tunnels",
      "kind": "transit",
      "title": "Tunnels Beneath the Gold",
      "prose": "Lantern-lit tunnels wind beneath the golden streets, thick with smoke and older secrets. Ilbrec, a broker with too many rings and too few scruples, eyes you from a stall of stolen relics.",
